								alt="dev.to Static Badge"
								src="https://img.shields.io/badge/dev.to-geauxweisbeck4?logo=devdotto&color=black"
							/>
						</a>
						<a href="https://medium.com/@geauxweisbeck4">
							<img
								alt="Medium Static Badge"
