							/>
						</a>
						<a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/geauxweisbeck4">
							<img
								alt="Static Badge"
								src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Buy_Me_A_Coffee-geauxweisbeck4?logo=buymeacoffee&logoColor=black&labelColor=yellow&color=white&link=buymeacoffee.com%2FGeauxWeisbeck4"
							/>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://patreon.com/GeauxWeisbeck4dev?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink"
						>
							<img
								alt="Static Badge"
								src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-geauxweisbeck4?logo=patreon&color=black&link=https%3A%2F%2Fpatreon.com%2FGeauxWeisbeck4dev%3Futm_medium%3Dunknown%26utm_source%3Djoin_link%26utm_campaign%3Dcreatorshare_creator%26utm_content%3DcopyLink"
							/>
						</a>
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="ml-16 col-span-5 text-left">
					
					<p class="text-md dark:text-global-text text-global-text mb-4">
						Hey y'all, I'm Andrew and I am a 35 year old entrepreneur and full stack developer, currently living in Durham, North Carolina. I have many interests including sports, computer science, philosophy, history, reading... the list goes on forever! You will find that I am very passionate about morals, programming, and entrepreneurship through my writing and I hope my words will inspire you and teach you more about who I am. There is more to say about me, but you will have to read through my content to get to know me better and the best place to start is with this digital garden.
					</p>
					<p class="text-md dark:text-global-text text-global-text mb-4">
						This digital garden will be my little corner of the internet to help you learn more about me, the world, entrepreneurship, psychology, creativity, programming, and many other interesting topics. My digital garden is the collection of ideas and notes as they are formed into full lenght articles that will be published here and on other writing platforms. I hope you find my work interesting and worth sharing with others, or even better, collaborating with me by leaving comments on the <a href="https://github.com/GeauxWeisbeck4/digital-garden-astro/discussions" class="dark:text-link text-link hover:text-accent">GitHub discussion section of this site</a> or by opening an issue on the <a href="https://github.com/GeauxWeisbeck4/digital-garden-astro/issues" class="dark:text-link text-link hover:text-accent">WeisGarden GitHub repo</a> with a development request for fixing errors or for new features you'd like to see as a reader.
					</p>
					
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
